Anders '''"SnipEr"''' Lindbäck was a top tier Swedish Quakeworld player during the first era, active between the years 1996 - 1999.

In [[Fragfest '96]], he was the second of the {{Flag/se}} [[Crusaders]] to play and did a good job, defeating {{Flag/se}} [[King]] (KI.) King led out of [[E1M1]] but suffered badly on [[DM6]], losing his advantage and quite a bit more.

